| **Pathway summary: all three audiences at a glance** Students follow the Learn, Work, Life pathway anchored by the Jisc Discovery Tool (New Students, Current Students, Employability Skills question sets) and Century Tech EDS diagnostics. Teachers follow the Digital Skills and TLA Pedagogy pathway anchored by the Jisc Teaching Staff question set and the ETF DTPF stages. All Staff follow the General Digital Skills pathway anchored by the Jisc Staff question set. All three pathways converge at the Innovating stage around AI literacy, responsible use, and institutional leadership. Progress through all three pathways is tracked and evidenced through the Digital Coaching Platform. |
